<title>UK: Saltire makes 5.5 mln stg disposals.</title>
<headline>Saltire makes 5.5 mln stg disposals.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>British industrial holding company Saltire Plc said on Monday it had conditionally agreed to sell its Joseph Mitchell (Letham) Ltd, Mitchell (Game) Ltd and Highland Venison Limited game and food businesses (&quot;HV&quot;) to Scot-Lad Ltd.</p>
<p>Saltire said Scot-Lad would pay a total 5.5 million stg for the companies, comprising 3.75 million cash and 1.75 million of Scot-Lad loan notes.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
